{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"content":"Henry sat rigid against the window, his forehead resting against the cold glass as the city lights blurred into streaks of amber and white. The rhythmic clacking of the wheels on the tracks offered little comfort, a mechanical heartbeat that seemed to mock the silence he had been trying to cultivate all day. He watched his own reflection—pale, haggard, with deep hollows beneath his eyes—overlaying the darkening countryside. The delay had been a blessing in disguise; it had given him the extra minutes he needed to finish the final paragraph of the letter lying folded in his pocket. Now, as the train picked up speed and the world outside dissolved into blackness, the reality of what he was about to do settled over him heavier than the fatigue he had been fighting since dawn.","role":"assistant"}}],"created":1792461071,"id":"chatcmpl-18e019d915d05da50070","model":"qwen3.8-27b-fp8","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"aien_sampling":{"greedy_tokens":0,"kept":[248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248